        "text": "# For Loop\n\nA **for loop** repeats a set of steps a specific number of times. \n\nFor example, this **for loop** prints out the numbers 1-10:\n\n```\nfor (let i = 1; i <= 10; i += 1) {\n  console.log(i)\n}\n```",
